{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24139","headline":"酬李二十侍郎 · 白居易","name":"酬李二十侍郎","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笋老兰长花渐稀，衰翁相对惜芳菲。\n残莺着雨慵休啭，落絮无风凝不飞。\n行掇木芽供野食，坐牵萝蔓挂朝衣。\n十年分手今同醉，醉未如泥莫道归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24139.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24139","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}